TokenDial
=========

This repository is released under the Apache License 2.0 (see LICENSE).

It builds on and vendors code from the following open-source projects, whose
licenses and copyrights are retained by their respective authors:

- DiffSynth-Studio (ModelScope Team), Apache License 2.0
  The `diffsynth/` package is a trimmed fork containing only the components
  required for Wan2.1-T2V-1.3B plus the TokenDial additions
  (per-layer rgb_token, rgb_cfg_scale guidance, and the TokenDial losses).
  https://github.com/modelscope/DiffSynth-Studio

- InternVideo2 (OpenGVLab)
  The `feature_losses/internvideo2/` directory is a trimmed vendored copy used
  only for the appearance feature loss during training.
  https://github.com/OpenGVLab/InternVideo

- Wan2.1 (Wan-AI / Alibaba) — the base text-to-video diffusion model.

The FlowEdit V2V method is adapted from:
  "FlowEdit: Inversion-Free Text-Based Editing Using Pre-Trained Flow Models",
  Kulikov et al., ICCV 2025. https://arxiv.org/abs/2412.08629

DINOv2 (Meta AI) is fetched at runtime via torch.hub for the motion loss.

